# Minimum Living Network

## Purpose

The minimum living network proves PoCP can run as a capability network.

## Minimum Nodes

```text
Node A: Human / Agent Node
Node B: Public Skill Node
Node C: Verifier / Reviewer Node
```

## Minimum Capability

```text
code_review
```

## Minimum Flow

```text
1. Create Human Entity.
2. Create Skill Entity.
3. Register Skill NodeProfile.
4. Publish PublicNodeEndpoint / manifest.
5. Register Capability: code_review.
6. Human / Agent discovers the Skill Capability.
7. Handshake occurs.
8. Signed Invocation is created.
9. Skill Node returns output_hash.
10. Skill Node submits Proof.
11. Verifier Node performs AI advisory verification.
12. Reviewer approves or rejects.
13. Settlement distributes CP / AIC.
14. TokenAccount updates.
15. Reputation updates.
16. Graph shows the full chain.
17. ProtocolEvent log records all major events.
```
